      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我认为普通一点就好了，\n但待兼诗歌剧的眼神非常认真。\n我该给她什么建议才好呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c812f89c73d6f2317daa7619a858045195aaaddda02b39802b50ddb1da91ca16",
